==Description==
'''Despair''' is a sticker obtained from Major II rank of the [[PVP Season 0]].

==Appearance==
The sticker shows the default Level 0 [[Minigunner]] holding its hands up in despair. It plays a short scream when used.

==Trivia==
*This sticker is based on the [https://knowyourmeme.com/photos/2369918-emoji Sad emoji getting disintegrated into dust] emoji.
*The emote description is a reference to [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JVy-6GChSrA this scene] from ''Avenger: Infinity War'', more specifiaclly when [[wp:Spider-Man|Spider-Man]] says "''Mr Stark I don't feel so good''".

